  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INVESTMENT PROGRAM TO PROTECT THE BARBADOS&apos; COASTS FROM EROSION. AND PROTECT THEM AS THE COUNTRY&apos;S PRIME NATURAL RESOURCE WHICH IS ESSENTIAL FOR THE SUSTAINABILITY OF BARBADO&apos;S MAIN ECONOMIC ACTIVITY I.E. TOURISM. THE SPECIFIC COMPONENTS INCLUDE: SHORELINE STABILIZATION WORKS, COASTAL ECOSYSTEM RECOVERY, COASTAL ACCESS IMPROVEMENT AND INSTITUTIONAL DEVELOPMENT</narrative>
